note Recursively collects the call sites inside one declaration. Anything whose node kind contains 'call' counts; the callee expression is its 'function' field. The extra work here is recovering a qualifier the grammar hid: some languages parse pkg.proc(x) as member(pkg, call(proc, x)), so the qualifier is the sibling before the call, not part of it.

