note The walk that produces symbols. Named children of the root become symbols; imports are diverted to record_import; comments, package clauses, attributes and bodyless 'mod foo;' are skipped. Containers (impl, mod, trait, class) recurse exactly one level so methods appear with their owner type, which is what gives depth 1 symbols and what a qualified call later binds against.

